{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/steamHeader.png?t=1743003366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a dark dense forest in which terrible inexplicable things happen. In recent years, many people have disappeared here, including the brother of the main character. You will have to find the missing people's belongings by following the coordinates left in the notes of the missing brother. Someone or something lives in the forest and changes everyone who goes there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There is no map</strong>. Navigate through the trees using only a compass and coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/ROT_gif1.gif?t=1743003366\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Someone buried all the evidence</strong>. A metal detector will help you find the right things, and with a shovel you can dig up not only them, but also useful items for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/ROT_gif2.gif?t=1743003366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Something is hiding in the dark</strong>. The detector can detect if there is anything unusual in front of you. The main thing is not to get too close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/ROT_gif3.gif?t=1743003366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features :</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The atmosphere of loneliness and dark dangerous forest. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unusual mechanics, such as the use of a biofield detector, metal detector, flare gun. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orientation on the terrain without using a map. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short duration of the game. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397850?t=1743003366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397850?t=1743003366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/9a83f80d2aec50acdce5d363a7c216431fef80f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743003366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/9a83f80d2aec50acdce5d363a7c216431fef80f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743003366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/steamHeader.png?t=1743003366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a dark dense forest in which terrible inexplicable things happen. In recent years, many people have disappeared here, including the brother of the main character. You will have to find the missing people's belongings by following the coordinates left in the notes of the missing brother. Someone or something lives in the forest and changes everyone who goes there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There is no map</strong>. Navigate through the trees using only a compass and coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/ROT_gif1.gif?t=1743003366\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Someone buried all the evidence</strong>. A metal detector will help you find the right things, and with a shovel you can dig up not only them, but also useful items for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/ROT_gif2.gif?t=1743003366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Something is hiding in the dark</strong>. The detector can detect if there is anything unusual in front of you. The main thing is not to get too close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/extras/ROT_gif3.gif?t=1743003366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features :</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The atmosphere of loneliness and dark dangerous forest. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unusual mechanics, such as the use of a biofield detector, metal detector, flare gun. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orientation on the terrain without using a map. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short duration of the game. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Red Kraken studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397850/c4751e906e091bc9d4295fdcc31ef55adc052573/header.jpg?t=1743003366","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118515,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118515/movie480.mp4?t=1742985531","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118515/movie_max.mp4?t=1742985531"},"name":"ROT first trail